   "lines": [
    "It was Rose's birthday;",
    "I rode over to Chestnut",
    "Hill where I lunched",
    "and spent the day,",
    "bringing over two",
    "fans for Rose &",
    "Alice. En passant;",
    "those two young",
    "ladies have cost me",
    "over $150 in fans.",
    "In the evening we[?]",
    "went to the strawberry",
    "night of the D.K.[?]"
